course: dictionary
lesson: 11100
title: Small word, big job: when
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: "When" is a small word with a big job. It can ask about time: «When is lunch?» It can also tell us the time, or the case, in which something happens: «When it rains, we stay in.»
explain: Look at the words around "when" to find its meaning. In «Call me when you get home», when means "as soon as": you ring the moment you arrive. The clue is what happens after "when".
explain: Sometimes "when" begins a rule. In maths, «When we put two groups together, we add» tells you what to do every time. Ask yourself: is "when" asking a question, giving a time, or stating a rule?
fact: "When" can ask a question about time, as in «When does it end?»
fact: "When" can mean "in the case where", as in «Put your bag on the floor when the bus is busy».
fact: "When" can mean "as soon as", as in «Call me when you get home».
fact: "When" can mean "although" or "since", as in «Why walk when you can ride?»
fact: Phrases such as «when I was little» talk about the past, and «say when» means "tell me when to stop pouring".
exercise: «A seat is for a person, so put your bag on your lap or the floor when the bus is busy.» What does when mean here? | *In the case where the bus is busy | It is the name of a bus stop | It means "although" | It asks a question about time
exercise: «Call me when you get home.» What does when mean? | Never | Since last year | *As soon as | It asks what time it is
exercise: «Why walk when you can ride?» Find and copy the word that means "although" here. | Why | walk | *when | ride
test: «You can't get burnt when it's cloudy.» What does when tell us? | It means "as soon as" the cloud arrives | *It tells us the case in which something happens | It is a name for the Sun | It asks a question
test: In «Say when», what does when mean? | *Tell me when to stop pouring | It means "although" | A day of the week | It asks what time it is
exam: Which formal phrase could replace when in «When does the bus leave?» | Since when | Once upon a time | Say when | *At what point in time
